WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
At five in the morning the hills are still blue.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Three generations climb the same terraces, each one holding a basket.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Lakshmi: My grandmother cut these steps with a hoe. I only walk where she made a path.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[Leaves rustle. Baskets knock softly against hips.]

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The youngest, Meena, is learning which two leaves and a bud to pick.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Meena: It is slow work. But when the sun comes over the ridge, nobody wants to be anywhere else.
